# Leave line endings alone.
#
# `* text=auto` (the reflexive choice here) is what CAUSES the wall of "LF will be
# replaced by CRLF" warnings on a fresh `git add`: it asks git to normalize, and
# git dutifully announces every file it intends to rewrite. On a single-user,
# single-platform vault there is nothing to normalize FOR, so the warnings are
# pure noise, and a first run that looks like it threw 28 warnings teaches the
# user to stop reading this tool's output.
#
# Windows-only by design (see the README), so `-text` costs nothing.
* -text
